      "value": "Currently we have to apply this logic to the Locomotion and FX layers in order to get full MMD compatiability, which I have done for my own avatar and can report no issues:\nhttps://vrclibrary.com/wiki/books/guide-to-mmd-dance-world-full-support-logic\n Unfortunately we shouldn't need to have to resort to this.",
