  "details": "Depending on the MMD world, IK2 Beta (regardless if 2.0 is on or on Legacy) bugs. It will either bug with the whole body being on the floor and movement is akin to primordial goo, or the face may stop blendshaping, or the body may not move from the start-point of the song (which may be 0,0,0, not sure).\nWorlds to test:\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_aea5c1d3-7abc-4287-acf8-200279c12700\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_66cc6289-1968-4d56-9f9f-5f8cd77bb192\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_7d2af18c-e4a1-4084-9cd2-b27432b45980\n^ This one is special as it's using a new system to direct the animator, or something, instead of relying on networked IK.\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_776a6a37-f307-43f4-aeef-8f151f38dba4",
